WEBVTT

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:45.680
Biscuit Oliva with his unrivaled strength.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.440
I've never seen such physical strength!

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:55.190
What an intense demonstration!

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:59.410
Is he showing us that strength
comes from muscle and might?

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:02.200
What an impressive inverted triangle!

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:07.210
It's clearly the antithesis
of Chinese martial arts techniques.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.210
Raitai Tournament round one.

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:15.210
We've had six matches,
including the special match.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:18.970
Four Sea Kings have already fallen
to our guest fighters.

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:21.260
Round one has three fights left.

00:02:21.550 --> 00:02:24.220
The Raitai Tournament has grown tense.

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:26.930
What's going to happen?

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:30.310
Round one, match number six.

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:34.980
The only Japanese Sea King here
is Kukendo user Sea King Jaku.

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:39.070
And here, Sea King Chin
is representing Fujian.

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:40.780
He's a Sangoken user.

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:43.660
Now, may the match begin.

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:53.500
Spirit and fists.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:58.090
Chinese martial arts use
a special mix of these two things.

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:01.090
By adding spirit to our fists,

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:05.010
we're at a higher level of martial arts
than any other country.

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:07.770
However, it's not enough.

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:11.770
That's why exceptional physical strength
can defeat it.

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:16.860
But we can add one more thing
to spirit and fist. It's earth.

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:19.150
Spirit, fist, and earth.

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:21.780
Sangoken uses a mix of these three things.

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:25.530
In other words,
you use the environment around you.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.160
I see.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:30.290
I thought it was just
a stupidly strong punch.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:33.040
But you added "earth" too.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.790
In other words, this concrete.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.550
Outsiders can be a Sea King
but only by title.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:43.130
You learn fast.

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:53.310
You were hanging on by a tiny thread.

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:55.060
Baki.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:57.360
I need a word, old man.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.150
Oh, a word with me?

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:04.910
You've changed.

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:09.040
You look like you want to fight
here and now.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.580
That is what I want.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:16.710
Your poison was neutralized
and you're feeling better.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:20.090
-And now you want to fight--
-You don't want to?

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.090
That's unlike you.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:27.850
I thought you'd rush at me
as soon as I brought up fighting.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:34.020
Unlike you, I don't brag about being
the world's strongest.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:38.110
Even if you were
the weakest creature here,

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:41.610
I'd be fine with being the second weakest.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.360
Just a tiny bit.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.740
If I'm stronger than you
even by a tiny bit...

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:47.870
that's fine.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:52.370
How many years has it been?

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.550
Four years and ten months.

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:04.380
The snot-nosed kid got a little stronger

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:06.880
and now wants to fight me?

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:09.010
Is that bad?

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.220
You sure talk a lot, old man.

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:14.560
Are you chickening out?

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:19.610
Earth, spirit, and fist.
This trinity creates the Sangoken.

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:22.280
It has yet to reveal any openings

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:24.650
for Japan's Kukendo techniques.

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:27.660
-It's so strong.
-The Sangoken.

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:29.450
Hey, Chin.

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:34.160
Chin, how about coming to Japan with me?

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.580
I have 24,000 pupils in Japan.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:42.500
-Would you train them with me?
-What?

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:46.920
What a twist!
He's headhunting at a time like this!

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:50.930
It's unusual to recruit
before the tournament has even ended!

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:55.140
Chin, I want you to join us
and teach techniques.

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:57.940
An unprecedented job offer!

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:01.690
How about it, Chin?

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:06.190
Focusing on strength alone is boring.

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:15.450
Chin.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:18.540
Wait for me until the tournament ends.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:22.460
I want you all to join me
as a prize for winning.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:25.550
He dislocated his shoulder!

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:28.050
We have a winner!

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:32.600
The Raitai Tournament

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.720
means nothing to us.

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:39.730
Or could it be that
you're actually scared of me?

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.730
-Baki.
-What?

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:45.480
Don't push yourself,
your legs are shaking.

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:46.980
What?

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.990
Confrontation or not, watch your mouth.

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:56.740
Don't ever say that I'm scared of you.

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.750
You beat a third-rate martial artist,

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:04.920
yet you talk like you're
a martial arts master.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:07.210
Fucking amateur.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.010
Get lost!

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:24.270
<i>He's strong.</i>

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:29.030
Hey, you!

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.400
<i>He's really strong.</i>

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.950
<i>Enough to boast about it.</i>

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.290
<i>They say there's always</i>
<i>someone better than you.</i>

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:45.460
<i>But in front of you,</i>
<i>those words feel empty.</i>

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:54.890
<i>Am I...</i>

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:01.560
<i>Am I feeling relieved right now?</i>

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:16.120
Master, I've returned.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:19.040
It seems the surgery will take time,

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:20.620
but he will live.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:22.460
Good work.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:27.130
How many hours have you been doing
the <i>Zhan Zhuang</i> stance?

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:29.880
Twenty-five years ago,

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.380
<i>on my first day of training,</i>

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:37.090
<i>this was the first thing I learned</i>
<i>from Master Ryu.</i>

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:39.760
And now...

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:43.180
Bailin Temple needs me!

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:47.770
There are two matches left in round one.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:51.280
Sea King Son has come on stage quietly.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:55.280
He's a Sekkendo user from Jilin.

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.870
And from the famous Bailin Temple is...

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:01.290
this long-awaited contestant.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:05.620
Many currently see him as
the most skilled Chinese martial artist.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.290
That's right, it's Sea King Retsu!

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:11.050
The famous Bailin Temple, I see?

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:14.840
Do the rings bother you?

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:17.550
Wondering if they'll be used as weapons?

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:19.300
I don't care.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:34.940
Amazing.

00:09:35.030 --> 00:09:36.570
His grip is incredible.

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:39.570
It's my first time breaking the seals...

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.870
in my seven years as Sea King.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.080
I'll make a fist with these fingers...

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.580
and strike you relentlessly.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:58.720
-They're going to fight using their grip!
-Begin!

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:04.640
In Japan, there's a young gangster

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:06.390
named Kaoru Hanayama.

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:10.310
<i>He had an incredible grip</i>
<i>that could tear off...</i>

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:13.270
<i>a chunk from a stacked deck of cards.</i>

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:17.400
This trick is impossible
at your current level.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:24.990
What's wrong?

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:27.160
Isn't this your expertise?

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:36.260
Son, give up the Sea King title.

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:40.260
Start over with basic <i>Zhan Zhuang.</i>

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:47.140
<i>The level of Sea Kings has dropped.</i>

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:49.890
We have a winner!

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:52.690
What a difference in skill!

00:10:54.650 --> 00:10:59.450
Sorry, Retsu, for bothering you
right after your match.

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:01.240
Not at all.

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:08.200
What did you sense?

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:09.660
What?

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:13.420
What did you think after the match?

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.170
Honestly speaking,

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:21.930
I'm incredibly disappointed.

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:26.100
In other words, you thought
those with the Sea King name

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:28.180
are lacking in ability.

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:31.190
Yes, it's as you say.

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:34.810
After seven matches in the first round,

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:40.190
you and I are the only two
Chinese victors remaining.

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:47.620
Can the three ministry men
stick out their dominant hands?

00:11:47.870 --> 00:11:49.700
-What?
-"Dominant hand"?

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:50.910
What?

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:56.040
They're such pretty hands,
much like a girl's.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:57.710
Stack them together.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:09.640
The culprits for this deplorable scandal

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:11.730
are none other than you ministry people.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:13.980
This is punishment.

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:16.400
Listen closely.

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:20.990
The Sea King name must never
be handed over to outsiders.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:32.580
This is my son, Shunsei,
from when I was 120 years old

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.420
and his friend, Ron.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:39.630
We'll make a team of Chinese Allied Powers
and add these two names.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:45.090
Please, wait. What will happen
to my match with Mr. Han?

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:48.680
If one of you doesn't show up,

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:51.270
then you can't have a match, right?

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.560
The Chinese Allied Powers team
is now complete.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:04.150
Did you hear?

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.450
It's the Chinese team
against the Japan-US victors.

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.830
It's a five versus five match.

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:12.910
Their motives are so obvious.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:17.540
It's so pathetic
that I can't say anything.

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:23.800
I'm truly sorry.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:27.300
The Chinese Allied Powers team

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.300
obviously includes you, right, Retsu?

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.060
That's how it is.

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:34.850
I see.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:38.190
I thought that only four of you were left.

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:41.070
What will they do about the last member?

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:43.650
Actually, Sea King Moh from our team

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.820
had an accident and will be absent.

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:48.070
That left us three members.

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:52.080
We then added two members
to be reborn into a five-person team.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.080
Will that be okay?

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:56.580
Using two people who aren't Sea Kings?

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.120
China is vast.

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:00.460
We need not worry about that.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:03.170
Can you tell us the two members' names?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.090
Shunsei Kaku

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:06.420
and Shobun Ron.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:09.340
<i>Shunsei the Crazy Beast</i>

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:11.140
<i>and Shobun the Badman?</i>

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:14.890
It's Shunsei and Shobun.

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:17.270
Oh, I see.

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:20.860
I can tell that Sea Emperor Kaku
is serious.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:24.360
Please accept this match.

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:28.950
I agree that the Sea Emperor seat
is meant for a Chinese fighter.

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:32.160
I want to fight for the championship

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:33.870
with only Chinese people.

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:35.620
On what condition?

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:40.880
It's polite to give presents
when making such a request.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.250
Our conditions...

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:48.380
I vow that our Chinese Allied Powers
will win all five matches.

00:14:51.720 --> 00:14:54.560
Hey, do you understand what a present is?

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:58.640
Fine, we'll accept
your five on five matches.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:02.520
No, Yujiro, we need a fair trade.

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:04.150
Shut up, Unchained.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:06.400
This isn't America.

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:11.990
He has the guts to brazenly state
such crazy conditions.

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:16.410
We can even have a one versus five match
if you'd like.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.460
It's decided.

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:28.760
Good.

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:31.470
Those idiots accepted.

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:33.260
How foolish of them.

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:34.640
Master.

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:36.810
In our world of martial arts,

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:40.560
your authority as our elder is absolute.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.190
However,

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:44.940
the current you is the worst!

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.230
I'm fine with that.

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:52.110
The Chinese martial arts world's
first crisis.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:56.530
No one could've predicted
the outsiders' formidable efforts.

00:15:56.990 --> 00:15:59.540
Chinese martial artists,
have you no pride?

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:02.080
Don't hand over the Sea Emperor title.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:05.540
The master, Sea Emperor Kaku,
has formed an emergency team.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:09.210
Chinese or not, all you need to do is win.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:11.720
-Sea Emperor Kaku.
-Yes?

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:15.840
You spouted some splendid words
backstage earlier.

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:18.220
Let me say those same words to you.

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:22.230
You're overflowing with deficiencies.

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:30.400
Yujiro Hanma is laughing.

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:32.740
It's as if his loud laughs

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:35.570
are his way of saying they'll win.

00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:40.620
China isn't a superficial country.

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.870
Chinese Kenpo is shamelessly
baring its fangs.

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:47.380
They vowed a perfect win.

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:50.460
Baki.

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:54.260
I've taken into account
China's 4,000-year history.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:56.640
I have, and yet...

00:16:57.260 --> 00:17:00.640
I won't accept Sea Emperor Kaku's
perfect win.

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:05.140
To be honest,
I want to make those 4,000 years

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:07.150
an absolute joke.

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:09.690
Baki.

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:12.480
Will you cooperate with me?

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:19.410
I hate you.

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:22.910
Your ideas, your lifestyle, your face...

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.330
I hate it all.

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:26.330
But...

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:30.090
right now,
your feeling about Chinese Kenpo...

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:34.420
is one thing I can agree with.

00:17:39.010 --> 00:17:42.890
<i>In any case, with each person</i>
<i>holding their own feelings,</i>

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:46.440
<i>a team was formed at this moment.</i>

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:50.110
-Yes?
-What a troublesome situation.

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:52.190
"Troublesome," you say?

00:17:52.900 --> 00:17:54.150
Shobun Ron.

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:59.950
I'm sure you know
exactly what kind of person he is.

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:03.950
Shobun Ron is 45 years old,
born in Taiwan.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.870
He met his master, Shikai Bun,
when he was nine

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.710
and became a martial artist.

00:18:08.790 --> 00:18:10.790
From age 15 until 19,

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:14.210
he won every Taiwan Raitai Tournament.

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:18.970
His skills were warmly welcomed
into Taiwan's underground society.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:21.390
Am I right so far?

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:23.970
So are you aware

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:25.560
of what happened next?

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.980
<i>There are matches held by</i>
<i>underground organizations.</i>

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:34.230
<i>A fighter is chosen</i>
<i>to represent each organization.</i>

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:37.990
<i>Two great men are made to fight</i>
<i>in a nightclub.</i>

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:43.370
<i>Matches generally end when a fighter</i>
<i>suffers a serious injury or death.</i>

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:46.290
<i>Bets were made with money,</i>

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:49.370
<i>and real estate</i>
<i>such as buildings and land.</i>

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:51.540
<i>This made the fights change.</i>

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:54.380
<i>They began using pros.</i>

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:57.510
<i>In addition to amateurs,</i>

00:18:57.590 --> 00:19:01.220
<i>organizations used athletes from</i>
<i>wrestling, Muay Thai, Kenpo, and more.</i>

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:02.800
<i>The fights escalated.</i>

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:07.930
<i>And on that stage, Shobun Ron came forth.</i>

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:11.520
<i>Undefeated for 25 years.</i>

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:14.440
No, that's not right.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:19.700
It's been about 30 years if you include
his Raitai fights when he was 15.

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.200
Basically...

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:23.950
-He's never been defeated.
-That's right!

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:27.740
I shouldn't have bothered.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:31.210
I have nothing more to tell you.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:32.540
Bye, then.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.460
I wish you luck in battle, Unchained.

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:45.680
You obviously know
Shobun Ron's nickname, right?

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:47.680
Of course I do.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:50.350
Mr. Unchained.

00:19:50.430 --> 00:19:51.850
MR. UNCHAINED

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:54.860
Which one is the real Unchained?

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:04.490
Here comes the man of unrivaled strength!

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:34.100
Begin!

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:36.810
Unrivaled strength.

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:39.610
It's even more amazing
when he's only in shorts.

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:42.780
A chest as big as an ass.

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:45.110
Arms bigger than his head.

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:48.530
Will attacks even work on him?

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.410
His hands are in his pockets.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.290
-Have you heard of Shobun Ron before?
-No.

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:57.290
Apparently, he did a bunch
of underground matches.

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:01.300
Now that you mention it,
that face looks dangerous.

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:03.920
Unrivaled strength versus dark Kenpo.

00:21:04.510 --> 00:21:07.300
Oliva is moving. He's closing in.

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:11.310
-Ron isn't ready.
-He's not even looking.

00:21:11.390 --> 00:21:12.310
What?

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:14.390
What?!

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:17.900
What's that sound?

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:20.320
All he did was swing down his arm.

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:24.900
Ron's feet sank into the concrete.

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:28.320
He took that impact with just one arm.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:31.330
These two are frighteningly strong.

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:34.330
Ron still has one hand in his pocket!

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:40.000
Both hands are out of his pockets!

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:50.470
Not even bullets can get through my body.

00:21:51.050 --> 00:21:54.470
Blood is coming from Oliva's steel abs!

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:56.480
Is it a knife?

00:21:56.890 --> 00:21:58.060
A spear-hand strike.

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:03.980
It's back in his pocket.

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:08.240
Oliva is on the attack!

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:20.250
It's Iai, a martial art.

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.210
IDIOTS FROM PLANET STRONG

00:23:49.170 --> 00:23:51.090
Subtitle translation by Chul Kim
